{"meta":{"id":"tt1116184","type":"movie","name":"Jackass 3D","imdb_id":"tt1116184","description":"Jackass 3D es una película filmada en 3D y la tercera película de la serie de Jackass. Sigue la misma premisa que las dos primeras películas, así como las series de TV. Es una compilación de varias travesuras, trucos y parodias. Antes de que la película comience, una breve introducción es hecha por el Beavis y Butt-head explicando la tecnología 3D detrás de la película. La entrada presenta el molde alineación y luego atacarse por varios objetos en el ralentí. La película marca el 10o aniversario de la licencia, comenzada en 2000.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt1116184.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2RmJI0jfXMFF0br3pXQsHiy3lgh.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7bf4ZTEWTRJzydh6r0o160466zU.png","genres":["Comedia","Documental","Acción"],"releaseInfo":"2010","released":"2010-10-15T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"94 min","imdbRating":"7.0","country":"United States of America","cast":["Johnny Knoxville","Bam Margera","Ryan Dunn","Steve-O","Chris Pontius","Jason 'Wee Man' Acuña","Preston Lacy","Ehren McGhehey","Dave England","Phil Margera","April Margera","Loomis Fall","Jeff Tremaine","Brandon Novak","Tony Hawk","Eric Koston","Spike Jonze","Trip Taylor","Rick Kosick","Dimitry Elyashkevich","Greg Iguchi","Manny Puig","Erik Roner","Judd Leffew","Lance Bangs","Gregory J. Wolf","Josh Brown","Mat Hoffman","Rake Yohn","Omar Von Muller"],"director":["Jeff Tremaine"],"writer":["Spike Jonze","Johnny Knoxville","Madison Clapp","Sean Cliver","David Weathers","Trip Taylor","Lance Bangs","Jukka Hildén","Rick Kosick","Greg Iguchi","J.P. Blackmon","Barry Owen Smoter","Knate Gwaltney","Derek Freda","Mike Kassak","Hannu-Pekka Parviainen","Jarno Laasala","Dave Carnie","Dimitry Elyashkevich","Jarppi Leppälä","Bam Margera","Chris Pontius","Jeff Tremaine","Steve-O","Harrison Stone","Dave Engl